        "created_at": "2018-06-05T01:40:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Blackfang108\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Blackfang108:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I wend down to Carbondale with my now-wife and another couple.&nbsp; Was awesome, and was worth the 9 hour drive from Carbondale to Urbana.&nbsp; (Usually just under 3 hours)&nbsp;My sister just moved into the path of totality for 2024, so that'll be a LOT easier.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Hey, I went to UIUC! I miss a lot of the restaurants.</p>\n<p>Yeah the drive back home after the eclipse only went from 3 hours to 5.5, but still not fun.</p>",
